{"id":14373879477,"name":"[FREE UGC] Carry Me! [2 Player Obby] ","desc":"\nUpdates bi-weekly!\n\nFree Ice Lantern from joining our group! \n\nEmbark on a long and painful journey with your partner as you jump, dive, throw, and climb to the top. This game is progressively difficult and can be rage - inducing. Remember to take frequent breaks and stay hydrated.\n\n1. Hit E on your buddy to pair up with them!\n2. Press E to pickup your buddy!\n3. Throw your buddy by pressing E again!\n\n👍 Thumbs up for future updates!\n\n[ If public servers are too difficult, you can create a free private one! ]\nCredit for some icons go to Digby Garrett","path":"/game/14373879477-free-ugc-carry-me-2-player-obby","slug":"14373879477-free-ugc-carry-me-2-player-obby","thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/bca5c3094907650b6ad94889d389f9a12fe4fabb7ecbd764d7215e18b371cbde.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-3bd960364574b0468a1fb4400be90320/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":74,"visitor":133520447,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2023-08-24T01:42:29.166Z","creator":{"name":"Sekuriyo","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":2,"freeCount":2,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0},"page":1,"next":null,"total":1,"scripts":[{"slug":"Carry-Me!-2-Player-Obby-Stage-Teleporter-7374","_id":"64e6b585e38cad14988fbc28","title":"Stage Teleporter","game":{"_id":"67e5e1ffb360710ec3c789e0","gameId":14373879477,"name":"[FREE UGC] Carry Me! [2 Player Obby] ","imageUrl":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/no-game.webp","original":null},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/no-game.webp","original":null},"placeId":14373879477},"features":"It have all stages\n\n--SCRIPT COINTAINS A SCRIPT THAT WILL SEND A WEBHOOK TO MY SERVER SAYING THAT SOMEONE IS USING THE SCRIPT HERE IS PROOF-- https://prnt.sc/VQCKCEZrAvHW","tags":["carry me","teleporter"],"script":"loadstring(game:HttpGet(\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Wh1t3Bl4ckPT/Scripts/main/Protected_6640836446039649.lua\"))()\nlocal Library = loa